      "citation": "2026 Mississippi House Bill 1546, enrolled — Chapter 430, Laws of 2026",
      "effect": "Amends Miss. Code Ann. §§ 99-19-71, 97-3-54.1 and 97-3-54.6. Reduces the felony expunction waiting period from five years to three and adds felony procuring prostitution and promoting prostitution as exclusions.",
